#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:5 3138a92d0a7d4411b6e096f4236e9d08
msgid "Trolling Motor"
msgstr "拖钓电机"

#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:9 24714036b1bc4033aba3a4dbe8d9927c
msgid ""
"This articles describes how to set-up a trolling motor for use with Rover"
msgstr "本文介绍如何为 Rover 设置拖钓电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:12 e4c9591724b641dcbba953c03d6a5445
msgid "What To Buy"
msgstr "购买清单"

#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:14 d3c45e777b8c4020a7dbe40fddcaa6c2
msgid ""
"Brushed trolling motor like the `Minn Kota Endura C2-30 "
"<https://minnkotamotors.johnsonoutdoors.com/freshwater-trolling-"
"motors/endura-c2>`__.  This can be powered from a 12V lipo battery and draws"
" about 15amps at top speed"
msgstr ""
"有刷拖钓电机，如 `Minn Kota Endura C2-30 "
"<https://minnkotamotors.johnsonoutdoors.com/freshwater-trolling-"
"motors/endura-c2>`__。可由12V锂聚合物电池供电，最高速度时电流约15A。"

#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:15 b9391c7623d94f0d84e19ece44147bfc
msgid ""
"Brushed motor controller with PWM input like the `Cytron SmartDrive 40 "
"<https://www.cytron.io/p-mds40b>`__ or one of the `RoboClaw brushless motor "
"controllers <http://www.basicmicro.com/34VDC_c_19.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"带 PWM 输入的有刷电机控制器，如 `Cytron SmartDrive 40 <https://www.cytron.io/p-mds40b>`__"
" 或 `RoboClaw 有刷电机控制器 <http://www.basicmicro.com/34VDC_c_19.html>`__ 系列之一。"

#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:16 19bc9945ca3f442ba1b121799fc2acb0
msgid ""
"3S Lipo battery with at least 20C rating and 5000mAh capacity (this should "
"allow running at full speed for about 15min)"
msgstr "至少20C放电率、5000mAh容量的3S锂聚合物电池（这应能支持全速运行约15分钟）。"

#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:19 ddbe5f86a4c24072b20b166f35b39e8f
msgid "Connecting and Configuring"
msgstr "连接与配置"

#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:21 11c22dae3b5a4286987db85f23822998
msgid ""
"Remove the upper handle and control section of the motor to expose the "
"positive and negative leads"
msgstr "拆下电机上部手柄和控制部分，露出正负极导线。"

#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:22 fc4c9f6c3b7a4219be02400c4263736b
msgid ""
"Connect the motor leads to the M1 terminals of the brushed motor controller"
msgstr "将电机导线连接到有刷电机控制器的 M1 端子。"

#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:23 9087691def534c0d867ca57298f3e54e
msgid ""
"Connect the motor controller's RC input to the appropriate RC output from "
"the autopilot (i.e. RC Output 3 for a :ref:`Separate Steering and Throttle "
"vehicle <rover-motor-and-servo-connections>`)"
msgstr ""
"将电机控制器的 RC 输入连接到飞控的相应 RC 输出（即对于 :ref:`独立转向和油门车辆 <rover-motor-and-servo-"
"connections>` 使用 RC 输出3）。"

#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:29 797c0c5352894a00a94fe7a4f8e74ddc
msgid ""
"Test the motor moves in the correct direction using the Mission Planner's "
"Motor Test page (see :ref:`Motor and Servo configuration <rover-motor-and-"
"servo-configuration>` wiki page).  If the motor spins in the incorrect "
"direction then reverse the black and red wires connecting the motor driver "
"to the motor or change the :ref:`SERVO3_REVERSED <SERVO3_REVERSED>` "
"parameter (assuming motor controller is connected to autopilot's RC Output "
"3)"
msgstr ""
"使用 Mission Planner 的电机测试页面测试电机转向是否正确（参见 :ref:`电机和舵机配置 <rover-motor-and-"
"servo-configuration>` Wiki 页面）。如果电机旋转方向错误，请对调连接电机驱动器与电机的黑线和红线，或更改 "
":ref:`SERVO3_REVERSED <SERVO3_REVERSED>` 参数（假设电机控制器连接到飞控的 RC 输出3）。"

#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:30 229ec9bc90f14f51a1118c9ad8fbd76b
msgid ""
"If the motor does not spin at full speed try lowering :ref:`SERVO3_MIN "
"<SERVO3_MIN>` and/or increasing :ref:`SERVO3_MAX <SERVO3_MAX>` (assuming "
"motor controller is connected to autopilot's RC Output 3)"
msgstr ""
"如果电机无法达到全速，请尝试降低 :ref:`SERVO3_MIN <SERVO3_MIN>` 和/或提高 :ref:`SERVO3_MAX "
"<SERVO3_MAX>` （假设电机控制器连接到飞控的 RC 输出3）。"

#: ../../source/docs/trolling-motor.rst:31 2d1c8b69ac9547b99a54b1b393762ef0
msgid ""
"If the motor moves slowly forwards or backwards when it should be stopped "
"then adjust :ref:`SERVO3_TRIM <SERVO3_TRIM>` (assuming motor controller is "
"connected to autopilot's RC Output 3)"
msgstr ""
"如果电机在应停止时缓慢前进或后退，请调整 :ref:`SERVO3_TRIM <SERVO3_TRIM>` （假设电机控制器连接到飞控的 RC "
"输出3）。"
